# Build context of docker/Dockerfile (the repository root). BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the
# Dockerfile. Keep the image to the package, its tests and the benchmark scripts.
.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.venv
venv*
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
site
build
dist
*.egg-info
**/results
**/logs
**/*.pt
**/*.ckpt
**/*lena_eesm_tables*
docs/img
